  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f69c6b1f1e1fc2c4b9a85c7696ada520, type: 3}
  m_Name: BeforeTutor2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSO
  replics:
  - "Hey, how old are you anyway? Doesn\u2019t it feel like a bit too much responsibility
    for someone your age to run an entire squad?"
  - "I\u2019m twenty. And I\u2019m in charge because I wasn\u2019t convicted of \u201Cdesertion\u201D
    and \u201Ccovering up crimes,\u201D unlike some people here. The chances of me
    screwing up or \u201Cbetraying\u201D anyone are lower."
  - " I protected someone I cared about. That\u2019s hardly betrayal."
  - "I\u2019m speaking from the perspective of the \u201Claw\u201D and the court.
    I have no personal issues with you\u2026 aside from the fact that I hate when
    you and Asahi smoke. It stinks."
  - "Hm\u2026 And what exactly did you do, according to the \u201Claw\u201D?"
  - "I\u2019ve known you all for two days. Why would I share anything with someone
    from a team that\u2019ll probably fall apart soon?"
  - "Just curious. At twenty, childhood shouldn\u2019t be over yet."
  - "\u2026"
  - "I saved myself and my brother. That\u2019s all you get."
